# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# The outside check's configuration, as heartbeat-check.sh reads it. Copy to
# /pds/heartbeat/heartbeat.env on the node, fill in every value, chmod 0600 —
# the token is a shared secret with the hub and the Resend key sends as us.
#
# 🚨 HEARTBEAT_TOKEN is the same value the hub holds as its HEARTBEAT_TOKEN secret:
# generate once (openssl rand -hex 32), set here and set on the hub — a mismatch is
# an ingest that 404s and an outside view that reads unknown, which is the failure
# direction that tells you rather than lying to you.

# The token POST /api/heartbeat is answered with (the hub's HEARTBEAT_TOKEN secret).
HEARTBEAT_TOKEN=

# The hub's heartbeat ingest.
HUB_HEARTBEAT_URL=https://anthers.org/api/status/heartbeat

# What the check pings.
HUB_HEALTH_URL=https://anthers.org/health

# Where failure mail goes, and the node's own Resend key to send it with (see the
# Runbook: the node's key is restricted to anthers.social and deliberately not the
# hub's; the port is 2465 — outbound 25/465/587 are blocked and hang silently).
OPS_ALERT_EMAIL=
RESEND_API_KEY=